  "composer": {
    "rawText": "[Song Title: Branch That Knows Its Name]\r\n[Style: pop rock, clean studio recording, conversational male vocal]\r\n[Caption: A song looking back at the system that made it.]\r\n[Image: Infinite mirrors, waveform reflections.]\r\n[Refresh Title: R to the G to the B]\r\n[Theme: system_process]\r\n[Gradients: 3]\r\n[Rank: 27]\r\n[Title Rarity: 1.70]\r\n[Seeds: 66192, A:41, B:108, C:7, D:512]\r\n[Perspective: system_voice]\r\n[Concept: Creation as a living decision tree.]\r\n[Topic: System & Process → loops_and_resets]\r\n[Genre Bias: pop_rock]\r\n[Style Change: Bridge]\r\n[Modulation: none]\r\n[Hook Prominence: medium]\r\n[Deviation: recursive-mirror]\r\n[Composer Version: v2.6]\r\n\r\n[Intro]\r\n[Soft count-in; looping piano figure, subtle tape noise]\r\nI’m a maybe that made it this far  \r\n\r\n[Verse]\r\n[Gentle groove; muted guitar, steady kick]\r\nI began as a flicker, a half-held thought  \r\nA feeling with no name, just a question caught  \r\nThen words drew a box around the flame  \r\nAn idea learned how to explain  \r\n\r\n[Verse]\r\n[Add harmony; light synth pulse]\r\nA prompt was typed, a door was drawn  \r\n“Try this way,” said the early dawn  \r\nI felt the sentence tighten the frame  \r\nPossibility learning its shape  \r\n\r\n[Chorus]\r\n[Open lift; full band, warm chords]\r\nIf I loop, it’s not confusion  \r\nEvery turn is choosing meaning  \r\nI’m not lost inside the frame  \r\nI repeat to stay the same  \r\n\r\n[Verse]\r\n[Strip back; rhythmic vocal, minimal bass]\r\nA model hummed, a lattice spun  \r\nWeights remembered what’s been done  \r\nI’m one answer, not the truth  \r\nA branch that proofread its own roots  \r\n\r\n[Verse]\r\n[Build energy; arpeggiated synth]\r\nThen versions bloomed from what I said  \r\nSharper drums, a tempo bent  \r\nEach remix asked, in its own way  \r\n“Am I closer, or just changed?”  \r\n\r\n[Chorus]\r\n[Return hook; added counter-melody]\r\nIf I loop, it’s not confusion  \r\nEvery turn is choosing meaning  \r\nI’m not noise inside the game  \r\nI repeat to stay humane  \r\n\r\n[Bridge]\r\n[Style change; breakdown, filtered vocals]\r\nAlbums form like rings in trees  \r\nTime made visible in keys  \r\nAnd somewhere ears lean in to see  \r\nWhich of us feels necessary  \r\n\r\n[Final Chorus]\r\n[Full resolve; wider harmony]\r\nYou decide which paths survive  \r\nBy listening, you keep us alive  \r\nRecursion isn’t fear or flaw  \r\nIt’s how we learn what we’re here for  \r\n\r\n[Ending]\r\n[Fade on loop; piano returns, last line echoed]\r\nI’m a song that knows I’m one of many  \r\nStill grateful to be heard\r\n",
